; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">\nInput row size and column size: </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">3 6</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">\n9 5 7 2 3 2\n2 0 4 1 2 7\n4 4 6 6 9 0</span></p>", "ide": "python", "quiz": "", "worksheet": "", "answer": "import random\n\ndef display(mat):\n    for r in mat:\n        for c in r:\n            print(c, end=\" \")\n        print()\n\nmat = []\nfor i in range(4):\n    row = []\n    for j in range(3):\n        row.append(random.randint(0, 9))\n    mat.append(row)\n\ndisplay(mat)\n"}, {"difficulty": "moderate", "step_id": 3, "description": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Create a </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: bold; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">function </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">that takes in a 2D list and display it in columns and rows.\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Write a program that performs the following:\n1. Asks user to input the row and column sizes of a 2D list separated by a space. \n2. Generate a 2D list with the rows and columns with all the values set to 0. \n3. Call the function to display the list.\n4. Asks user to input a row index and column index in the 2D list separated by a space.\n5. Set the value at that row and column to 1.\n6. Call the function to display the list.\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Follow the test output display format and comment your codes.</span><br></p><p><span style